reports/qa/US-03-qa-report.md:16:The QA app used Chrome against Angular on `127.0.0.1:4200`, proxied to Strapi 5.63 on `127.0.0.1:1338`. Strapi used the disposable database `/private/tmp/us03-qa-run/strapi.sqlite`. No existing development volume or customer data was used. Local server binding and Chrome launch required scoped sandbox escalation because the sandbox denied loopback binding and browser process launch.
